  ($emailextract$EVALUATION_REPORT$emailextract$,
   $emailextract$Horse evaluation report$emailextract$,
   $emailextract$Delivers a completed evaluation report as a PDF. Three voices in one template: the buyer's own copy, a copy shared with someone else, and a guardian-addressed copy when the report belongs to a minor.$emailextract$,
